"It was the fire within\nI failed it so badly \nDidn't gave it enough fuel\nHanged with the dreadly\n\nIt was the fire within \nEven unfueled it burned\nBurned hotter than many fueld\nThey saw and were stunned\n\nIt was the fire within\nWho burned the evil tree\nNow I shall repay it\nAnd give it the fuel to make it free\n\nThe free blaze of the fire within \nShall engulf the forest of darkness \nWill illuminate everything's in path \nShall heal not destroy the awakeness"